    "metadata": {
      "notes": "Synchronous buck: V1=12V in, M1 high-side / M2 low-side switch at 10 kHz (PER=100us) with ~42% duty and 1us dead time (V3/V2 PULSE gate drives), L1=1mH, C1=100uF, R1=5 ohm load -> ~5V/1A output. Matches the default TRAN settings (t_end=10ms, t_step=10us, i.e. 100 switching cycles) so it runs cleanly with no setup needed -- just open this file and click Run."
